gf-three vfx: the effect styles' sprites (standin/), where each comes from

Ours (MIT, like the rest of the kit), drawn from SVG by scripts/make-vfx-standins.mjs:
  puff-toon.png, puff-ink.png, star.png, ring.png, square.png

From the asset library, with their licences (scripts/make-vfx-standins.mjs reads them from the library's store by the
manifests' sha256; create writes each one's credit into a game's ATTRIBUTION.md when the game uses it):
