                   downscaled to 128 px. CC0-1.0, Kenney (www.kenney.nl).
  fireball.png     Quiver's Outpost Assault, die_fx_spritesheet.png
                   (library/packs/quiver-outpost-fx/assets/explosion-flipbook.json; github.com/quiver-dev/tower-defense-tutorial
                   at 9f5cc040da4eca020afd8b10afefc238dd30708d), downscaled from 1280 to 640 px.
                   CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/): "Explosion art from Quiver's Outpost
                   Assault (github.com/quiver-dev/tower-defense-tutorial), CC BY 4.0", changed: downscaled.
